---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Base title="Home">
  <div class="shell">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{profile.roles}</p>
        <h1 id="intro-title" class="serif">I'm Drew<br /><em>Cleaver.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-location">{profile.location} · Glad you found your way here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <p>I like figuring out how things work—and helping people think through what to do next.</p>
        <p class="muted">I've built a physical-product business, worked in enterprise sales, and spent a fair amount of time at racetracks. These days, I'm also exploring how AI can help us put good ideas to work.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button" href="/contact/">Have something on your mind? <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={profile.bookingUrl}>Schedule a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="background-section" aria-label="A little context">
      <p class="eyebrow muted">A little context</p>
      <div class="background-grid">
        <div class="background-item">
          <h2>Built from an idea.</h2>
          <p>I co-founded Higher Hangers, taking a patented product from an idea to customers around the world.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="https://higherhangers.com">Higher Hangers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="background-item">
          <h2>Learned in the field.</h2>
          <p>Before that: technical sales and enterprise accounts at Baker Hughes and Weatherford. Complex problems, real relationships.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/about/">My background <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="background-item">
          <h2>Let's talk it through.</h2>
          <p>A fresh idea, a business decision, or a problem that needs another perspective. Tell me what you're working on.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="advisory" aria-labelledby="advisory-title">
      <div class="advisory-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Founder advisory</p>
          <h2 id="advisory-title" class="serif">What are you trying to figure out?</h2>
          <p>Sometimes it helps to have someone look at the whole situation with you. Bring me the idea, the decision, or the problem you keep coming back to.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="advisory-list">
          <div class="advisory-item"><h3>An idea worth testing</h3><p>What needs to be true? What's the smallest useful way to find out?</p></div>
          <div class="advisory-item"><h3>A business decision</h3><p>Product, e-commerce, partnerships, or growth. Make sense of the options and decide what comes next.</p></div>
          <div class="advisory-item"><h3>A better way to work</h3><p>Find where AI and simpler systems could help with the work you actually do.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="advisory-footer">
        <p>You don't need a polished brief. A few sentences will do.</p>
        <a class="button button-light" href="/contact/?reason=advisory">Tell me about it <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="open-door" style="padding-top: 3rem" aria-labelledby="open-title">
      <h2 id="open-title" class="serif">The door is open.</h2>
      <p>A question, a collaboration, or something that doesn't fit a category: you're welcome to reach out. For advisory and project work, I welcome pay-what-you-want proposals. Tell me what would be useful and what it's worth to you. We'll agree on scope and price before starting.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/contact/">Send me a message <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={profile.bookingUrl}>Find a time to talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
